  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "著者　ヘザーによって　書かれたパルデアの大穴の　探検記。つたない文字で　フトゥーと　書かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "헤더가 집필한 팔데아의 대공 탐험기. 서툰 글씨로 “투로”라고 쓰여 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由海哲撰寫的帕底亞巨坑探險記。拙劣的字跡勾勒出「弗圖」二字。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un récit d’exploration du Cratère de Paldea signé par un certain Bruyer. Quelqu’un y a inscrit le nom « Turum » d’une écriture maladroite.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Bericht über eine Expedition im Schlund von Paldea, an der der Verfasser Alondo teilnahm. Auf den Einband ist recht unbeholfen der Name „Futurus“ gekritzelt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diario de exploración en el que el autor, Eriad, narra sus incursiones en el foso de Paldea. Tiene escrito \"Turo\" con una letra descuidada.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Resoconto della spedizione nella Voragine di Paldea redatto da Callugaris. Sul libro c’è scritto \"Turum\" con grafia un po’ maldestra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A record of the expedition that the author, Heath, went on within the Great Crater of Paldea. The book has the name “Turo” written on it in clumsy handwriting.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "著者　ヘザーによって　書かれたパルデアの大穴の　探検記。つたない文字で　フトゥーと　書かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由海哲撰写的帕底亚巨坑探险记。以拙劣的字迹写着“弗图”二字。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
